## Detailed Architecture Design

### System Architecture

#### High-Level Architecture
```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "External"
        U[Users]
        E[External APIs]
    end
    
    subgraph "Presentation Tier"
        W[Web App]
        M[Mobile App]
    end
    
    subgraph "API Gateway"
        G[Gateway Service]
        A[Auth Service]
    end
    
    subgraph "Business Logic Tier"
        S1[User Service]
        S2[Order Service]  
        S3[Payment Service]
        S4[Inventory Service]
    end
    
    subgraph "Data Tier"
        D1[(User DB)]
        D2[(Order DB)]
        D3[(Payment DB)]
        D4[(Inventory DB)]
        C[(Cache)]
    end
    
    subgraph "Infrastructure"
        Q[Message Queue]
        L[Logging]
        Mon[Monitoring]
    end
```

#### Component Interactions
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant G as API Gateway
    participant A as Auth Service
    participant O as Order Service
    participant P as Payment Service
    participant I as Inventory Service
    
    U->>G: Create Order Request
    G->>A: Validate Token
    A-->>G: Token Valid
    G->>O: Create Order
    O->>I: Check Inventory
    I-->>O: Inventory Available
    O->>P: Process Payment
    P-->>O: Payment Success
    O-->>G: Order Created
    G-->>U: Order Confirmation
```

### Data Architecture

#### Data Models
```sql
-- Core domain entities
CREATE TABLE users (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY,
    email VARCHAR(255) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
    created_at TIMESTAMP NOT NULL,
    updated_at TIMESTAMP NOT NULL
);

CREATE TABLE orders (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY,
    user_id UUID REFERENCES users(id),
    status VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,
    total_amount DECIMAL(10,2) NOT NULL,
    created_at TIMESTAMP NOT NULL,
    updated_at TIMESTAMP NOT NULL
);
```

#### Data Flow
```mermaid
graph LR
    A[Input Data] --> B[Validation Layer]
    B --> C[Business Logic]
    C --> D[Data Transformation]
    D --> E[(Primary Storage)]
    E --> F[Event Generation]
    F --> G[Message Queue]
    G --> H[Secondary Processing]
    H --> I[(Analytics Storage)]
```

