### API Design

#### RESTful API Standards
```yaml
# OpenAPI specification example
openapi: 3.0.0
info:
  title: [System Name] API
  version: 1.0.0
paths:
  /api/v1/users:
    get:
      summary: List users
      parameters:
        - name: limit
          in: query
          schema:
            type: integer
            minimum: 1
            maximum: 100
            default: 20
      responses:
        '200':
          description: Successful response
          content:
            application/json:
              schema:
                type: object
                properties:
                  data:
                    type: array
                    items:
                      $ref: '#/components/schemas/User'
```

#### Event-Driven Architecture
```json
